License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This is a modified distribution, not an official upstream release.
Local changes through 2026-10-21 remove obsolete pipeline suppression,
correct scoped memory deletion/compatibility behavior, and add opt-in read-only
group/speaker profile recall for QunLing group conversation. Profile retrieval
is bounded and survives embedding failures; default explicit-request recall,
memory writes, plugin identity and persisted configuration remain unchanged.
The local version is 0.2.7+local.3. The exact upstream commit was not recorded with the original
local copy; no commit identity is asserted here.
Original upstream attribution and author/name installation identity are retained.
See the local repair documentation. The repository's compatibility patch records
the earlier local.2 changes; current packages are built from this source tree.
